        "description": {
          "raw": "Daimon forms a bond with the ally placed behind him during battle preparation. Whenever Daimon gains a shield, the bonded ally also receives 24% + 3% (SP-based) of that shield for the same duration. While shielded by Daimon, the bonded ally gains an extra 15 + 1 (SP-based) Life Drain and 25% + 2% (SP-based) ATK. If the bonded ally is defeated, Daimon will immediately bond with the weakest ally.",
